        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/750623f119b8/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "快到賽拉村啦!抄這條近路很快就到了。怎樣?還是帶著我比較好吧?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/750623f119b8/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "老是走這種小道,搞不好會碰上強盜喔!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/750623f119b8/scenes/0/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "誰說的,這條路隱密的很,只有我才知道.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/750623f119b8/scenes/0/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "看,前面好像有人呢!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/750623f119b8/scenes/0"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "小路遇襲"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "豹"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/750623f119b8/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/750623f119b8/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "text": "你們想到賽拉村嗎?你們是來幹什麼的?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/750623f119b8/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "干你屁事!不要礙路!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "豹"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/750623f119b8/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/750623f119b8/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "text": "首領說得沒錯,果然有人抄小路來偷襲了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/750623f119b8/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "什麼偷襲?把話講清楚!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "豹"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/750623f119b8/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/750623f119b8/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "text": "少裝了!死吧!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/750623f119b8/scenes/1"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "龍人看熱鬧"
