          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 25,
              "speaker_name": "謝多"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/750623f119b8/scenes/2/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-25",
          "text": "吼..好像是人類在打架。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 26,
              "speaker_name": "聖寇拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/750623f119b8/scenes/2/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-26",
          "text": "呼..好像很有趣,我們去打人少的那一邊!"
